 "remarks": "Welcome to 2 Maplewood Terrace, Unit #2! This second-floor unit features 2 bedrooms, 1 full bath and over 1,400 SQFT. It also offers a huge, heated attic with flexibility for a playroom, storage, and more. Nice carpet throughout the living spaces, and a fresh paint job. Newer fridge and new gas range. Has back entrance from the back yard, and also a rear deck entry, deck for reserved use of the tenant, and a backyard for shared use amongst both tenants. Off-street parking in front of the house for 1 Car, and additional street parking. Quiet side road off of Main Ave. Gas station, pharmacy, restaurants, shopping, and bus stop in walking distance. No washer or dryer; Giant Laundry 1 minute away on Main Ave. Basement and Garage are reserved for the Landlord. Close to Rt-7 Connector to i-95, and to Merrit Parkway. Available Immediately. Good Credit is a Must, Proof of legal source of income, 2 months of paystubs for most recent 2 months of work. Please use RentSpree for credit report. This means all adults 18+. Please include legal ID for all adults with offers. Please submit offers as a single pdf file.",
